cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Machine Learning Mapping of HIV-TB Co-infection across Ghana's 261 Districts"
abstract: >
 Reproducible pipeline for spatial distribution, determinants, and ML-based risk
 prediction of HIV-TB co-infection across Ghana's 261 administrative health districts.
 Methods: Univariate and bivariate Moran's I, LISA, Gi*, GWR, LightGBM ensemble,
 SHAP interpretability. LightGBM LODO-CV AUC=0.998; GWR R2=0.916;
 Moran's I=0.810 (univariate), 0.449 (bivariate). Dataset fully deduplicated
 with 261 unique districts (Guan added 2026-05).
